  "prefLabel": "Puc 2202.12 Enrollment",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2202.12 “Enrollment” means the commencement of a customer’s electricity supply service from a CPA serving as an LSE, or a CEPS serving a CPA under contract, effective on the meter read date described in Puc 2004.10(a) following successful EDI notification by a CEPS or a CPA serving as an LSE to the utility.\n\nSource. #13457, eff 10-12-22",
